{"id":"e4f81d62107f6eeb","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-post.md","title":"Post定理与各层停机完备性","display":"thm-post — Post定理与各层停机完备性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-post","aliases":["43-thm-post"],"display":"thm-post — Post定理与各层停机完备性","depends_on":["[[43-df-sigman]]","[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-many-one]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Theorem 5.6.5, print pp.19–20 / PDF pp.39–40","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-post"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-post</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-post — Post定理与各层停机完备性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"af898f828e135b93\" href=\"?note=af898f828e135b93\" title=\"43-df-sigman\">43-df-sigman</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ac13d054390a6b63\" href=\"?note=ac13d054390a6b63\" title=\"43-df-many-one\">43-df-many-one</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 5.6.5, print pp.19–20 / PDF pp.39–40"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；Σ、Π、Δ见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"af898f828e135b93\" href=\"?note=af898f828e135b93\" title=\"43-df-sigman\">43-df-sigman</a>，CE^B见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m\">\\(\\le_m\\)</span>见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ac13d054390a6b63\" href=\"?note=ac13d054390a6b63\" title=\"43-df-many-one\">43-df-many-one</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Sigma^0_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{CE}^{\\varnothing^{(n-1)}}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\Sigma^0_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{CE}^{\\varnothing^{(n-1)}}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta^0_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\le_T\\varnothing^{(n-1)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\Delta^0_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\le_T\\varnothing^{(n-1)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing^{(n)}\\in\\Sigma^0_n\\land\\forall B\\in\\Sigma^0_n\\ (B\\le_m\\varnothing^{(n)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varnothing^{(n)}\\in\\Sigma^0_n\\land\\forall B\\in\\Sigma^0_n\\ (B\\le_m\\varnothing^{(n)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>增加原书同时陈述的Δ层次刻画和多一完备性。原稿Theorem 5.6.5(ii)以n≥0书写时第0层边界不宜机械套用，因此这里明确n≥1。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 5.6.5, print pp.19–20 / PDF pp.39–40。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-sigman","status":"resolved","id":"af898f828e135b93","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-sigman]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-many-one","status":"resolved","id":"ac13d054390a6b63","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-many-one]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-sigman","status":"resolved","id":"af898f828e135b93","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；Σ、Π、Δ见 [[43-df-sigman]]，CE^B见 [[43-df-ce]]。$\\le_m$见 [[43-df-many-one]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；Σ、Π、Δ见 [[43-df-sigman]]，CE^B见 [[43-df-ce]]。$\\le_m$见 [[43-df-many-one]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-many-one","status":"resolved","id":"ac13d054390a6b63","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；Σ、Π、Δ见 [[43-df-sigman]]，CE^B见 [[43-df-ce]]。$\\le_m$见 [[43-df-many-one]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_m","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\Sigma^0_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{CE}^{\\varnothing^{(n-1)}}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\in\\Delta^0_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\le_T\\varnothing^{(n-1)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varnothing^{(n)}\\in\\Sigma^0_n\\land\\forall B\\in\\Sigma^0_n\\ (B\\le_m\\varnothing^{(n)}).","display":true}],"bytes":1267,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-post]] — Post定理与各层停机完备性"}],"outgoing":["af898f828e135b93","6c0559518cd32104","b3936ae4c5d2dc79","0784d1de3a88cd94","ac13d054390a6b63"]}